<title>USA: McCormick &amp; Co to buy back 10 mln shares.</title>
<headline>McCormick &amp; Co to buy back 10 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>SPARKS, Md. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>McCormick &amp; Co Inc said on Thursday it would buy back up to 10 million shares of its outstanding stock from time to time in the open market.</p>
<p>McCormick said it completed its most recent repurchase program of two million shares.</p>
<p>McCormick produces spices, seasonings, flavorings, and specialty foods.</p>
</text>
